<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Spicer Mitchell, City Hold in talks.</title>
<headline>Spicer Mitchell, City Hold in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African firms Spicer Mitchell Holdings Ltd and City Investment Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that they are still in talks which if successful could affect their share prices.</p>
<p>The firms advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in their shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
